      <h3 class="major">Step 3: Become a member</h3>
      <p>If BH II feels like the right fit, joining is straightforward. Annual membership is SGD 280 — roughly $23 a month — covering both Toastmasters International dues and your BH II club membership in full. There is no separate joining or registration fee.</p>
      <p>You are welcome to attend as a guest more than once before deciding to join. Take your time.</p>
